ever who recently swallowed."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0379:b003:l016","ordinal":324584,"en":"Don't look at me,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0379:b003:l017","ordinal":324585,"en":"Bezildegan Kulchoro,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0379:b003:l018","ordinal":324586,"en":"Don't miss your mare's milk."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0379:b003:l019","ordinal":324587,"en":"Disappear from my eyes,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0379:b003:l020","ordinal":324588,"en":"Too bad for myself."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0379:b003:l021","ordinal":324589,"en":"Kanchoro's blood,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0379:b003:l022","ordinal":324590,"en":"Take a look and find out"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0379:b003:l023","ordinal":324591,"en":"Put on your proper clothes."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0379:b003:l024","ordinal":324592,"en":"May it not be too late,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0379:b003:l025","ordinal":324593,"en":"My anger comes by accident"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0379:b003:l026","ordinal":324594,"en":"I keep reading."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0379:b003:l027","ordinal":324595,"en":"Hurry up and leave."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0379:b003:l028","ordinal":324596,"en":"The collar is gold, the sleeves are copper"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0379:b003:l029","ordinal":324597,"en":"Goodbye, sparrow eye,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0379:b003:l030","ordinal":324598,"en":"If the find is good, it will not pass."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0379:b003:l031","ordinal":324599,"en":"If you shoot blindly, the bullet won't go through."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0379:b003:l032","ordinal":324600,"en":"If you meet, you will not be able to pass."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0379:b003:l033","ordinal":324601,"en":"Akolpok is what you want"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0379:b003:l034","ordinal":324602,"en":"I gave it as a gift, wear it."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0379:b003:l035","ordinal":324603,"en":"That our roots are together,"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0379:b003:l036","ordinal":324604,"en":"Know the value of this!"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0379:b003:l037","ordinal":324605,"en":"If you slip, get off the road."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0379:b003:l038","ordinal":324606,"en":"It seems that you are in pain"},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0379:b003:l039","ordinal":324607,"en":"I'm angry."},{"id":"seytek-2012:p0379:b003:l040","ordinal":324608,"en":"Whatever you want, Akkelte"}]
